libpkgcheck(3)

# NAME

libpkgcheck - transaction-bound package check authority

# SYNOPSIS

```
#include <libpkgcheck/libpkgcheck.h>
```

# DESCRIPTION

*libpkgcheck* admits one exact transaction check node against its unique build
predecessor and one successful native build result. It retains the source-owned
check program, exact check-input trees, and typed terminal result evidence.

The library does not prepare resources or execute programs.

# SEE ALSO

*pkgcheck_request*(3), *pkgcheck_result*(3), *libpkgbuild*(3),
*libpkgtransaction*(3)
